      "id": "claim_2d2891aad9d440999757098d14258b87",
      "statement": "make up and make seed are pinned to ENV=local for migrations: make up migrates only when ENV=local and the compose file has a postgres service (localdb profile), and seed depends on migrate only under ENV=local; against a managed database migrations are a separate deliberate 'make migrate ENV=staging' because the backend refuses to boot on an unmigrated database.",
