      "statement": "Supabase Storage configuration (SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY) is global rather than per-environment: with the backend on local Postgres, documents rows are local but archived objects land in the cloud bucket; ENV=staging puts both together, and staff-source is therefore staging-only.",
