      "statement": "Optional subsystems are enabled by derived Settings properties: auth_enabled when SUPABASE_URL is set (empty means every request is the seeded dev user), graph_enabled needs both NEO4J_URI and OPENAI_API_KEY, langfuse_enabled needs both Langfuse keys, storage_enabled needs SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY; unset, they degrade rather than crash (uploads return 503, archiving skipped).",
